Minato's patch to frameworks/base's media/java/android/media/audiofx/Visualizer.java at android-15.0.0_r1 (Apache-2.0),
the audio effects plan: the static initializer loads no libaudioeffect_jni, and the setup passes no attribution source.

Why: as audioeffect-without-audioeffect-jni.patch: the natives are libandroid_runtime's
(framework/native/android_runtime/android_media_Visualizer.cpp), registered when the process starts, and the
attribution source is a parcel for the audio server's permission check, which Minato's runtime does itself (the
microphone grant).

--- a/media/java/android/media/audiofx/Visualizer.java
+++ b/media/java/android/media/audiofx/Visualizer.java
@@ -74,7 +74,7 @@
 public class Visualizer {
 
     static {
-        System.loadLibrary("audioeffect_jni");
+        // Minato: the natives are libandroid_runtime's (android_media_Visualizer.cpp), registered at the start.
         native_init();
     }
 
@@ -232,12 +232,8 @@
 
